activate SP
SP -> DB : Calculate weekly stats\nfor all active users
activate DB

loop For each user
    DB -> DB : Count games this week
    DB -> DB : Calculate rating changes
    DB -> DB : Update weekly performance
end

DB --> SP : Weekly stats updated
deactivate DB

SP -> CACHE : Clear all user caches
activate CACHE
CACHE --> SP : All caches cleared
deactivate CACHE
deactivate SP

== Database Schema Optimization ==
note over DB
  Optimized queries using indexes:

  INDEX idx_user_recent_games
  ON user_games(user_id, created_at DESC)

  INDEX idx_user_wins_losses
  ON user_games(user_id, result, created_at)

  INDEX idx_weekly_stats
  ON user_games(user_id, created_at)
  WHERE created_at >= DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL 7 DAY)
end note

